From: Peyton Howe <peyton@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: IMX415 overlays for ROCK 5B+

Clock the Radxa Camera 4K at 24 MHz. The 720 MHz link frequency selects
the mainline driver's 4-lane 1440 Mbps mode (3864x2192 at about 60 fps).
The 360 MHz link frequency selects 4-lane 720 Mbps (about 30 fps).

CAM0 is i2c3/csi2/isp0. CAM1 is i2c4/csi4/isp1.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile
